# Ignore .agents contents (installed skill copies, hooks state, tooling), but
# keep the repo-local skill SOURCES tracked (AGENTS.md mandates
# .agents/skills-src/<name>/). A bare `.agents` would exclude the directory
# itself and make re-including anything under it impossible.
.agents/*
